<title>USA: Triple P not to extend contract of CFO.</title>
<headline>Triple P not to extend contract of CFO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Triple P NV said Monday the contract of Dirk Vertogen, chief financial officer, will not be extended.</p>
<p>The company said Vertogen, hired in September 1996 to assist in its restructuring program, has completed his goals.</p>
<p>Vertogen's responsibilities will be shared between Jan Bruinenberg, corporate controller, and Ed van Moorsel, treasurer, Triple P said.</p>
